This package contains the alpha source release of Anteater Chess,
including source code, tests, build scripts, and documentation.
It is an early preview release and some optional or advanced features
may still be incomplete.

Directory overview:
- src/
  Source files
- include/
  Header files
- tests/
  Unit tests
- bin/
  Build output directory
- doc/
  Documentation

Supported Makefile targets:
- make
- make test
- make clean

After building, run the program with:
   ./bin/chess

For user-level instructions, please refer to doc/Chess_UserManual.pdf.
For architecture and module-level details, please refer to
doc/Chess_SoftwareSpec.pdf.